      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-47914",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/c7/c71cd99f4206a34b6e14c92fbeb3d8a7c9ecd989eed8344ef827b18d782ce260.png)\n\nConsider the Venn diagram above. The set $F$ represents all of the students in a school that play football, and $B$ represents all of the students in the same school that play basketball. Find the probability that a randomly selected football player also plays basketball.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
